MODULE: SwapOnlyAfterCopyAndFenceCopyIncomplete
TARGET: SwapOnlyAfterCopyAndFence
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the snapshot advances while a routed shard has not been copied
PERTURBS: CopyComplete

--- FIND
    /\ copied = captured
    /\ phase' = "fence"
--- REPLACE
    /\ copied \subseteq captured
    /\ phase' = "fence"
--- END
